# Rust build output
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak

# Velox compiler artifacts
# The C backend emits <out>.c next to the binary — never commit those.
*.c
# Keep hand-written C if any (none today, but be explicit):
!src/**/*.c

# Built executables (veloxc writes outputs without extensions)
/hello
/par
/bad
/a.out
# Catch any bare executable the user built at repo root:
/*.out

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Docs output (mdbook / velox doc, when added later)
/docs/book/
/docs/errors/_site/

# Local scratch
/tmp/
*.log